{"slug":"tundra-music-collective-conveyed-a-lively-single-track-rawk-on","postId":75820,"title":"Tundra Music Collective Conveyed A Lively Single Track, \"RAWK ON\"","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tundra Music Collective</strong>'s \"<strong>RAWK ON</strong>\" is a high-energy hip-hop track that combines elements of Afrobeat to create an epic, genre-defying sound. The Canadian-based artist brings their unique blend of infectious rhythms and bold lyrics to the table, delivering a standout performance that will get listeners pumped. Whether you're a fan of hip-hop or Afrobeat, \"<strong>RAWK ON</strong>\" is a must-listen for anyone looking for a fresh, exciting new sound.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://open.spotify.com/track/53zKZtPTTMlBgpqsfGph2g\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"spotify\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-spotify wp-block-embed-spotify wp-embed-aspect-21-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://open.spotify.com/track/53zKZtPTTMlBgpqsfGph2g\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>CLICK HERE TO STREAM:&nbsp;<strong>Tundra Music Collective's&nbsp;</strong>\"<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.spotify.com/track/53zKZtPTTMlBgpqsfGph2g\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">RAWK ON</a>\" on Spotify.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>CONNECT WITH&nbsp;<strong>Tundra Music Collective:</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://instagram.com/tundramusiccollective\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Instagram</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/6DIYLgBixMVsWmwwcX4xOK\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Spotify</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://soundcloud.com/good-people-music-837956956/sets/tundra-rawk-on\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SoundCloud</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp